  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Complete Live Ingestion & People Hierarchy",
      "items": [
        "1. **All Telemetry Flows to Ingestion:** Every event (triggered or not) lands in `source_event_stream` carrying `person_id` (FK to `person`) and `queue_id` (FK to `queue_map`).",
        "2. **Team Hierarchy:** `team` anchors LOB, Tower, Team Lead (`tl_person_id`), and Manager (`mgr_person_id`).",
        "3. **WFM Queue Mapping:** `queue_map` links contact center queues to their assigned `team` (`team_id` FK)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Violations, Escalations & Rules",
      "items": [
        "1. **Instance Trigger:** Rule breaks produce records in `monitoring_instance` pointing back to `source_event_id` and `person_id`.",
        "2. **Every Instance Notifies:** Recorded in `notification_log`; Strike 3 escalates to `incident_log`.",
        "3. **Rule Audit:** Multi-level scoped rules in `rules_master` track historical edits in `rule_version`."
      ]
    }
  ]
